  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H123_062_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 E2 01}白钟大人混乱了！\n啊……真不像那位聪慧的白钟大人……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0005/battle/support/bsv123.bvp_(061).BMD.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H123_062_009",
